---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Anushka Sheoran">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Anushka Sheoran</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-content prose">
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Ontario, Canada</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-line"></div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">BS Bioinformatics · UCSD</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-line"></div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-marker active"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">MS Computer Science · Penn</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="now-section">
        <h2>now</h2>
        <ul class="now-list">
          <!-- FLAG FOR REVIEW: confirm Curious Cardinals is still current -->
          <li>mentoring high schoolers through Curious Cardinals</li>
          <li>reading: [TODO, fill in a current book or paper]</li>
          <li>job searching, focused on frontier AI and life sciences</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bio-section">
        <p>I'm a second-year master's student studying computer science at the University of Pennsylvania. I'm drawn to interesting challenges at the intersection of AI and biology, which I'm approaching from several angles: healthcare policy research with Rachel Werner, single-cell bioinformatics in Dan Beiting's lab at Penn Vet, and looking at generative model applications through a course with Pranam Chatterjee.</p>

        <p>Before Penn I studied bioinformatics at UC San Diego, where I worked at the FDI Lab on RNA-seq analysis and biomedical data harmonization for the Open Data Commons for Spinal Cord Injury. That research was published in <em>Experimental Neurology</em>.</p>

        <p>I also work with Clariem Consulting, an AI consulting firm focused on pharma and life sciences, where I've built AI-powered tools and internal infrastructure.</p>

        <p>I serve as the Anthropic Campus Ambassador at Penn and run the Claude Builder Club, where we organized the Anthropic and Penn AI Hackathon, run a startup incubator called Foundry, and host an end-of-semester demo night.</p>

        <p>My longer arc is in AI evaluation and safety in clinical and multi-turn agentic settings, with a particular interest in how this connects to health systems work in India over the next decade.</p>

        <p>[TODO, short personal paragraph: where you're from, what you do outside work, anything that makes the page feel like you]</p>
      </div>

      <div class="community-section">
        <h2>community</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Claude Builder Club, Penn — President</li>
          <li>Penn Hindu Yuva (PHY) — member</li>
          <li>Anthropic Campus Ambassador, Penn</li>
          <li>Curious Cardinals — mentor</li>
          <li>Wharton Penn Biotech Group — consulting project</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    padding: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
  }

  .about-content {
    padding: var(--space-4) 0;
  }

  .timeline {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .timeline-line {
    flex: 1;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--border);
    min-width: 40px;
  }

  .timeline-marker {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    background: var(--border);
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .timeline-marker.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
  }

  .timeline-content {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .timeline-location {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .now-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .now-section h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .now-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .now-list li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .now-list li::before {
    content: '·';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .bio-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .bio-section p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .community-section h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .community-section ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .community-section li {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .community-section li::before {
    content: '·';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-header {
      padding: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-1);
    }

    .about-content {
      padding: var(--space-2) 0;
    }

    .timeline {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .timeline-item {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .timeline-line {
      display: none;
    }

    .timeline-content {
      text-align: left;
    }

    .bio-section {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    }

    .community-section h2 {
      padding-top: var(--space-2);
    }
  }
</style>
